{
  "id": "b1-e03-getting-around-the-city",
  "level": "B1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Getting around the city",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. In this test, I'm going to ask you some questions about yourselves. Let's begin.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you get to school or work every day?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you prefer travelling by bus or by train? Why?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, tell us about a journey you made recently.",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, is it easy to travel around the place where you live?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q5",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you ever ride a bicycle?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q6",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, how do you think you will travel to your next holiday?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p1-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Photograph",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'm going to give each of you a photograph. I'd like you to talk about it on your own for about one minute.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7500
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b1-e03-a1"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, here is your photograph. It shows people waiting for a bus in the rain. Please tell us what you can see.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "b1-e03-b1"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, here is your photograph. It shows a young woman cycling to work in a city. Please tell us what you can see.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now, in this part of the test, you're going to talk about something together for about two or three minutes.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 150,
          "diagram": "b1-e03-getting-around-the-city",
          "text": "Some people want to make travel in their town better. Here are some ideas the town could try. Talk together about the different ideas, and say which would be the most useful.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about travelling around town.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Do you think people should use their cars less? Why?",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 40,
          "text": "Candidate A, what do you think is the most difficult thing about travelling in a big city?",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 40,
          "text": "Candidate B, would you like to live in a place without cars?",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Is it better to travel to work by bike or by public transport?",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 40,
          "text": "Candidate A, how could your town help people who find it difficult to travel?",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e03-getting-around-the-city/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
